          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:362c9d9cdb1929ccd08176913ce619bdf36359f0dfac37c22f00e945fe2b08ff:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fdaff60948e047ec80cc308c10888f13",
      "statement": "On a label rename, UpdateLabel runs AuditLabelLinksAsync inside the same transaction: every existing label_albums link is re-verified via GET /albums/{id} and ExtractRealLabel - exact matches are re-upserted correcting stale label_spotify, verified mismatches and 404 albums are unlinked, and any other unverifiable link (GET failure, 5xx/429, cancellation, or no usable label) aborts the audit with LabelLinkAuditIncompleteException.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/katalog-api/src/Katalog.Api/Features/Labels/UpdateLabel.cs#L49-L70",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7e32b983e902309904370e9454f3775d67a41288c125e1020c44a129cec60f5a:"
