      "statement": "When AuditLabelLinksAsync throws LabelLinkAuditIncompleteException, UpdateLabel rolls the whole rename back (the label keeps its old name and all links) and returns RenameVerificationFailed, which LabelsEndpoints maps to 503 Service Unavailable with a retry-when-Spotify-is-reachable problem-details body.",
